Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your home is full of things you're supposed to remember and don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The HVAC filter that was due two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.74,0:00:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The water heater warranty quietly expiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The safety recall you never heard about until it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Appliances don't remind you — and the cost of forgetting is real:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,breakdowns, voided warranties, safety risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,HomeKeeper fixes this. Every appliance remembered. Every task on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,HomeKeeper is a home-appliance manager built for the Alexa+ track,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,for homeowners and renters who'd rather ask than remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One honest note: Alexa's developer tools weren't available to our account —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the Alexa AI CLI path is gated behind an Amazon-internal allowlist —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so the Echo Show you see is a high-fidelity web simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.24,0:00:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But everything it shows comes from a REAL backend on AWS:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,seven MCP tools on Lambda + DynamoDB, with Bedrock Claude for chat and vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.31,0:01:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Simulated Alexa+ experience, real MCP backend — it's written right on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the app working. “Alexa, what needs attention at home today?”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One MCP call — get_home_briefing — and there's the whole household:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,an overdue filter change, two tasks due soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,a warranty expiring in 20 days, and a live safety recall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,pulled from the CPSC feed every morning at 6 AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,365 milliseconds, straight from DynamoDB — no LLM, no guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tap any row and get_appliance shows brand, model, warranty, full maintenance history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,“Alexa, the water heater is making a strange noise.”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,report_issue pulls the complete picture —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,five years old, still under warranty until October 24th, last maintenance on record —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,plus a knowledge-base note: usually sediment buildup, and flushing the tank often fixes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's in warranty, the card recommends going through the manufacturer's warranty process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Deterministic, under half a second, rule-based and labeled as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,“Alexa, I want to add a new appliance by photo.”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,start_photo_onboarding mints a one-time token and a QR code.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Scan it with your phone, photograph the nameplate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment the photo lands in S3, Bedrock Claude Vision extracts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the brand, model, serial number, and manufacture date — each with a confidence score.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick the category, hit confirm, and add_appliance writes it to DynamoDB for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A thirty-second task that used to mean digging through a filing cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And for anything else, just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,“When does the water heater warranty expire?”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bedrock calls the same MCP tools, asks which water heater I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and answers from the real warranty record — never invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,HomeKeeper: a hot path under 500 milliseconds with zero LLM cost,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and Bedrock judgment when it's actually needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Every appliance remembered, every task on time.
